<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n24748" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">in-vestis</span></b> , e, adj.
		2. in, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>unclothed</i> (postclass.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b> In gen.: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">homo nudus et investis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Tert. Pall. 3</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b> In
			partic. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>A.</b>
			<i>Without a beard</i>, <i>beardless</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">puer,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">App. M. 5, p. 171</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">id. Mag. p. 336</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">pueri et puellae,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Macr. S. 3, 8</span></i>
			; Fest. s. v. vesticeps, p. 368 Müll.—
			</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b>
			<i>Unmarried</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">vir,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Tert. de Vel. Virg. 8</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">id. ib.
			11</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>C.</b>
			<i>Deprived of</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">investis dotalibus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Tert. Ux. 2, 9</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
